The series rebuilds what we run
==============================

Tarball plus patches did not reproduce the working tree. Six files differed — the engine's prompt and
provider reset, the MCP tool surface, the persona and two UI files — because those edits were made in
the tree and never cut back into a patch. A patch series that builds something other than the thing
being tested is worse than no series: it looks verified and is not.

This patch closes the gap. Applied after 0092, the series now produces the working tree byte for byte.

